{"synopsis":"Lu Ye, Nine-Lives Heavenly Sovereign yang dikagumi semua orang, pada hari dia naik ke alam Immortal, justru dikhianati oleh delapan Empress yang dibesarkannya sendiri. Nine Heavens Sword Princess: “Karena kau, seluruh dunia memanggilku sebagai pelayanmu!” Fairy Hong Ling: “Kalau bukan karena kau, aku sudah menjadi pasangan abadi dengannya. Kau pantas mati!” Vermilion Demon Empress: “Kau bilang mereka yang menyakitiku? Justru yang menyakitiku adalah dirimu sendiri!” Dengan Space-Time Reversal, Lu Ye terlahir kembali. Di kehidupan baru ini, dia bersumpah tidak akan mengulangi kesalahan yang sama, dan membiarkan delapan wanita itu menghadapi nasib mereka sendiri!","alternative_title":"八女帝全背叛，重生悔到肠断","author":"番茄小说, 李3疯","artist":"熊漫社","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"6ca1313f-f748-441d-91f0-b7214611dcce","number":"33","chapter":"33","title":"","date":"2026-07-29","released":"2026-07-29","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38e76ae6-5cbf-4f97-ba8f-508f1e5507bb/chapter_ch_33/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38e76ae6-5cbf-4f97-ba8f-508f1e5507bb/chapter_ch_33/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38e76ae6-5cbf-4f97-ba8f-508f1e5507bb/chapter_ch_33/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38e76ae6-5cbf-4f97-ba8f-508f1e5507bb/chapter_ch_33/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38e76ae6-5cbf-4f97-ba8f-508f1e5507bb/chapter_ch_33/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38e76ae6-5cbf-4f97-ba8f-508f1e5507bb/chapter_ch_33/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38e76ae6-5cbf-4f97-ba8f-508f1e5507bb/chapter_ch_33/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38e76ae6-5cbf-4f97-ba8f-508f1e5507bb/chapter_ch_33/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38e76ae6-5cbf-4f97-ba8f-508f1e5507bb/chapter_ch_33/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38e76ae6-5cbf-4f97-ba8f-508f1e5507bb/chapter_ch_33/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38e76ae6-5cbf-4f97-ba8f-508f1e5507bb/chapter_ch_33/11.webp","https